      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The amount of people who like these concepts in the discord beta discussion chat is crazy. \n\nY'all need to hire this dude. If I was an investor in VRC I'd ask you to fire whoever you've got and hire this Van Gogh of design concepts. \n\nThese are way better than what you've all made. Tenfold. \n\nThis concept with the yellow names has to be my favorite so far. Still don't like the profile decor, but thats another issue.  Everything about this looks great \n\nTo add on the profile decor, it can make the nameplate harder to read so that needs to be a heavy consideration so possibly outlining the names could help greatly or, adding a heavy drop shadow to the text would be great.",
